                                    content: `<h3>Social Sharing Tags</h3>
• <b>Open Graph</b> tags control how your link looks on WhatsApp, LinkedIn and Facebook.<br>
• <b>Twitter Card</b> tags do the same for X.<br>
• Without them your shared link shows no image and no description - it looks untrustworthy and gets far fewer clicks.<br><br>

<h3>Performance Hints</h3>
• <b>preconnect</b> - open the connection to a domain early.<br>
• <b>dns-prefetch</b> - resolve the DNS early.<br>
• <b>preload</b> - fetch a critical file at high priority.<br>
• These save real milliseconds on fonts and hero images.<br><br>

<h3>The canonical Link</h3>
• Tells search engines which URL is the <b>real</b> one.<br>
• Prevents duplicate content penalties when the same page is reachable at several URLs.`,
