                                    content: `<h3>6. Real Time Examples (Advanced)</h3>
&bull; <b>Multi brand retail platform.</b> One deployment serves several store fronts. Each brand only sets <b>--brand</b>, <b>--radius</b> and <b>--font</b> on <b>&lt;html&gt;</b>, and thousands of components inherit them.<br>
&bull; <b>Design token pipeline.</b> Figma tokens are exported to CSS custom properties on <b>:root</b>. Because they inherit, dark mode is a single media query that redefines the same names.<br>
&bull; <b>Web component library.</b> A payments widget exposes <b>--pay-accent</b> as its public styling API. The host page sets it and it crosses the shadow boundary through inheritance.<br>
&bull; <b>Chat widget isolation.</b> A support widget injected into unknown merchant sites uses <b>all: revert</b> plus its own tokens so host inheritance cannot break it.<br>
&bull; <b>Accessible high contrast mode.</b> Forced colours mode relies on inherited <b>color</b> and on <b>currentColor</b> borders so icons stay visible without extra CSS.<br>`,
